## Dataset name
Netflix Movies and TV shows till 2025

## Kaggle Source
A curated dataset of Netflix content sourced from TMDb, including titles, genres spilt between movies and tv shows
netflix_movies_detailed_up_to_2025.csv 7.86 MB (https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/bhargavchirumamilla/netflix-movies-and-tv-shows-till-2025)
netflix_tv_shows_detailed_up_to_2025.csv 6.97MB (https://www.kaggle.com/datasets/bhargavchirumamilla/netflix-movies-and-tv-shows-till-2025)


## Dataset used
This tabular dataset consists of listings of all the movies and tv shows available on Netflix.
It includes details such as titles, genres, release dates, ratings, descriptions, and other relevant metadata. 
The dataset has been curated to provide a comprehensive overview of Netflix's content library, making it useful for data analysis, recommendation systems, and trend exploration.
